+   *        |                         : |                               :
+   *        |            ...Saturday..: |_Sports_                       :
+   *        |            :                       |                      :
+   *        v            v                       v                      v
+   *   +---------+  +---------+            +---------+             +---------+
+   *   |    *    |  |   Sat   |            |    *    |             |   Sun   |
+   *   | Cooking |  |    *    |            | Sports  |             |    *    |
