+   *   | total=1 |  | total=3 |            | total=5 |             | total=3 |
+   *   +---------+  +---------+            +---------+             +---------+
+   *      :          |   |                   : | | :                     |
+   *    Saturday     | Sports                : | | :                  Sports
+   *      :          |   |  .....Saturday....: | | :.....Sunday.......   |
+   *      :    _Cook_|   |  :            _Foot_| |_Bask_             :   |
+   *      :   |          |  :           |               |            :   |
