+   *   | Cooking |  | Sports  |  | S/Football |  | S/Basketball |  | Sports  |
+   *   | self=1  |  | self=0  |  | self=0     |  | self=0       |  | self=0  |
+   *   | total=1 |  | total=2 |  | total=2    |  | total=3      |  | total=3 |
+   *   +---------+  +---------+  +------------+  +--------------+  +---------+
+   *                    |              :                 :               |
+   *                    |_Foot_  ..Sat.:                 :.Sun..   _Bask_|
+   *                           | :                             :  |
+   *                           v v                             v  v
+   *                     +------------+                   +--------------+
+   *                     |    Sat     |                   |     Sun      |
+   *                     | S/Football |                   | S/Basketball |
