+     *                         .     |A,*|             .     |A,*|   |*,1|
+     *                         .     +---+             .     +---+   +---+
+     *                         .     B                 .     B   1   A   2
+     *                         .     |                 .     |   :   |   :
+     *                         .     v                 .     v   v   v   v
+     *                         . +---+                 . +---+   +---+   +---+
+     *                         . |B,*|                 . |B,*|   |A,1|   |*,2|
+     *                         . +---+                 . +---+   +---+   +---+
+     *                         .     1                 .     1   B   2   A
+     *                         .     :                 .     :   |   :   |
+     *                         .     v                 .     v   v   v   v
+     *                         .     +---+             .     +---+   +---+
+     *                         .     |B,1|             .     |B,1|   |A,2|
+     *                         .     +---+             .     +---+   +---+
+     *                         .         2             .         2   B
+     *                         .         :             .         :   |
+     *                         .         v             .         v   V
