+     * where the self-sum is calculated as the sum of the node's self value
+     * plus the sum of its descendants' self values (summed over all
+     * dimensions):
+     *
+     *   selfSum(N, V) = self(N, V) + sum over all descendants C of N {
+     *       self(C, V)                                                 (B)
+     *   }
+     *
